{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/36","id":5441564386,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVB5edM8AAAABRFeu4g","html_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pull/36","diff_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pull/36.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pull/36.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/issues/36","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/36/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/36/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/issues/36/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack/statuses/61a504eec3ec3de828ccd80076212533ef58644b","number":36,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ADP: test that a grandmaster change in WAITING draws its delay from 0 to 4 s","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[A820] Assert the GM_CHANGE-in-WAITING draw kind, with a planted defect it catches\n\nRelates to kebag-logic/milan-fpga#970 (the [A10] ruling, item 4) and review finding R887-1-F1 on #35.\n\n#35 is closed without merge. This branch, `970-gm-change-draw-kind`, starts fresh from main `715589c1` and carries one commit, `61a504e`. No constant, source or behaviour changes: `git diff --stat 715589c1 61a504e -- src include` is empty.\n\n## What\n\nR887-1-F1 found that the suite holds no assertion on the draw a GM_CHANGE in WAITING makes. MFDISC-01 and Milan v1.2 5.6.3.5.7 say it is the TMR_DELAY of 0 to 4 s. A planted wrong kind at that call site passed all 10 stack test binaries, and only the milan-fpga parent's walk caught it.\n\n| File | Change |\n|---|---|\n| `tests/test_adp.cpp`, A2 in `AdpCore.A0toA2Schedule` | Right after `adp_gm_change` in WAITING: the machine is in DELAY, the draw is `ADP_DRAW_DELAY`, the armed delay is the recorded draw, and it is at most 4,000 ms, a literal. Message: \"A2 GM_CHANGE in WAITING: DELAY with a 0..4 s draw (5.6.3.5.7)\" |\n| `tests/mutations.json` | New plant `gm-change-draws-startup-kind`: `adp_gm_change` enters DELAY with `ADP_DRAW_STARTUP`. It is killed by that message in `AdpCore.A0toA2Schedule`, and its original test is the parent walk's `GM_CHANGE_x_WAITING` cell |\n| `docs/TESTS.md`, `docs/TRACEABILITY.md` | Regenerated by `test_inventory.py --write` and `traceability.py --write` (line numbers and the new plant) |\n| `docs/VERIFICATION.md` | 474 core plants (was 473) |\n| `CHANGELOG.md` | The entry |\n\n## Validation\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| The plant on the base `715589c1` | escapes: `ctest` 10 of 10 pass (R887-1-F1 reproduced) |\n| The plant at `61a504e` | caught: `adp_tests` fails with \"A2 GM_CHANGE in WAITING: DELAY with a 0..4 s draw (5.6.3.5.7)\" |\n| `python3 scripts/validate.py --work <w> --jobs 8 --graphs` on a clean clone of `61a504e` | rc 0, 28 of 28 gates rc 0; mutation `{\"CAUGHT\": 478, \"ESCAPED\": 0, \"ERROR\": 0}` |\n| `python3 scripts/baremetal.py --work <w> --jobs 8` | rc 0, Debug and Release |\n\nToolchain: GCC 16.2.1; the host Clang 23 (the CMake gates' `clang`); the pinned Clang 18.1.3 and clang-tidy 18.1.3; cppcheck 2.22.0; GoogleTest/GMock 1.14.0; Mermaid CLI 11.16.0; riscv64-elf-gcc 16.2.0; QEMU 11.1.3.\n\n## Not in scope\n\nThe ADP draws stay as main has them: 0 to 4 s on LINK_UP, DISCOVER, TMR_ADVERTISE and GM_CHANGE in WAITING, and 0 to 2 s at a startup with the link up (the ruling on #970). The parent's pin is not moved by this branch.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-22T17:39:11Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T17:42:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c919b3d7890b385f6c051cf5828d770ea779c6b1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kebag-logic:970-gm-change-draw-kind","ref":"970-gm-change-draw-kind","repo":{"id":1411276404,"node_id":"R_kgDOVB5edA","name":"tsn-c-stack","full_name":"kebag-logic/tsn-c-stack","owner":{"login":"kebag-logic","id":142733852,"node_id":"O_kgDOCIHyHA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142733852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic","html_url":"https://github.com/kebag-logic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kebag-logic/received_events","type":"Organi